{"id":"labor","lemma":"labor","pos":"noun","rank":4465,"glosses":["labor","job, task, chore","work, effort"],"ipa":"/laˈboɾ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"labores"},"examples":[{"text":"Tengo mi propia labor que hacer.","en":"I have my own chores to do.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803996","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"own","l":"propio"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"Tengo algunas labores que hacer.","en":"I've got some chores to do.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803993","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do"}]},{"text":"¿Ha estado Tom haciendo sus labores?","en":"Has Tom been doing his chores?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803992","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"country, land"},null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"his, her, its, their"},null]},{"text":"Sólo nos tomó quince minutos terminar la labor.","en":"It only took us fifteen minutes to complete the job.","words":[null,{"g":"us"},{"g":"to take","l":"tomar"},{"g":"fifteen"},{"g":"minute","l":"minuto"},{"g":"to finish"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Lo peor de vivir solo es tener que hacer todas las labores del hogar.","en":"The worst part about living alone is having to do all the chores yourself.","words":[{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"bad","l":"malo"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"home"}]}]}